<title>GERMANY: Deutsche Telekom -no need to raise capital.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Telekom -no need to raise capital.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Deutsche Telekom AG said on Sunday it had no plans to seek an increase in its authorised capital nor was there any need to.</p>
<p>&quot;No increase (in the capital) is planned. It is not necessary,&quot; Telekom chief financial officer Joachim Roeske said in response to a question after a news conference to announce details of its flotation on Monday.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
